OL,3,CMan charged with attempted murder
OL,4,Cafter city centre stabbing
OL,6,FA man has been charged with attempted
OL,7,Fmurder after a 19-year-old man was
OL,8,Fstabbed in Manchester City Centre on
OL,9,FFriday.
OL,11,FBandar Alzahar, who's 21, has been
OL,12,Fcharged with attempted murder and
OL,13,Fpossession of a bladed article in a
OL,14,Fpublic place.
OL,16,FHe'll appear at Manchester & Salford
OL,17,FMagistrates Court on Monday 3 August.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/2
