OL,3,CMan charged with attempted murder
OL,4,Cafter city centre stabbing
OL,6,FThe 19-year-old man, who was attacked
OL,7,Fon Church Street on Friday remains in
OL,8,Fhospital in a stable condition but
OL,9,Fwith life-threatening injuries.
OL,11,FPolice are asking anyone with
OL,12,Finformation to come forward.
OL,14,FThis can be submitted by calling 101,
OL,15,Fquoting log 1580 of 31/07/2026.
OL,17,FAlternatively, information can be
OL,18,Fprovided anonymously via the
OL,19,Findependent charity Crimestoppers on
OL,20,F0800 555 111.
